            "import_csv": {
                "title": "Import events from CSV",
                "description": "Columns: name, type, day, month, year (optional), icon (optional). `type` must be one of: birthday, anniversary, name_day, wedding_anniversary, memorial, pet_birthday, work_anniversary, custom (always in English, regardless of your language setting). Keep every column even when a value is empty - a row with a missing trailing comma shifts the following values left. Invalid rows are skipped and logged.\n\nExample:\n```\nname,type,day,month,year,icon\nAnna,birthday,12,4,1988,\nMax,pet_birthday,3,9,2020,mdi:dog\nTest Custom,custom,1,1,,mdi:test-tube\n```",
